Application analytics and crash reporting are distinct from ReefEvolve lighting-system diagnostic reporting.
Third-party services may process information independently of the lighting system's Bluetooth or Wi-Fi connection, depending on their configuration.
We will disclose applicable third-party processing and provide permissions, choices, or consent mechanisms where required by law or app-store policies.
